%% Route A — Windows SDK path (official), with where this project hooks in
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User program (Python/C++)
    participant S as episode_sdk (ours)
    participant H as Official upper computer (Windows)
    participant P as PCAN / USB2CAN
    participant D as Joint drivers (FOC, vendor)

    U->>S: angle_mode(q[6], speed_ratio)
    Note over S: validate: 6 values, finite, limits, 0<ratio≤1
    S->>H: [8 B length BE][{"action":"angle_mode","params":[[...],r]}]
    H->>H: plan point-to-point move (vendor)
    H->>P: CAN frames (IDs / rate: TBD, not documented)
    P->>D: CAN
    H-->>S: [8 B length][estimated_duration_s]  (reply ≠ completion)
    S-->>U: MotionAck(estimated_duration_s)
    loop until settled or timeout (ours)
        S->>H: get_motor_angles
        H->>P: request positions
        D-->>P: encoder angles (motor side)
        H-->>S: [q1..q6] (entries may be null)
    end
    Note over U,S: completion decided from measured feedback, not from sleep(estimate)
